# main stick's sideways push (re4_turn_scale, runtime/modern_move.cpp): the game makes left and right keys of the
# stick (game/pad.cpp, 30..150 degrees past 30 of 72) and turned at its full SPEED_WALK_TURN / SPEED_RUN_TURN for
# any push. Now full from 56 of 72 on, slower below, 35 % at the least; the D-pad (stick at rest) and a full push
# turn as the game does. Turning on the spot (pl_R1_Turn, a motion of its own) and the quick turn stay as they are.
# Not a bug of the prototype, all discs.
